                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "ive been playing steam games for years now. Im fully aware of the risk you take getting into an early access game, but this was just down right horrible.  \n1. once you enter the game there is no way to exit the game without hitting the windows key and manually closing the game window.\n2. the map is very very small with no boarder and if you fall off the map you just fall. no death, no restart. nothing, you just fall. then you have to revert to the first issue i posted. \n3. there are no animals in which to hunt for food so you can forget about that. and as i wondered the small map i saw nothing that would give you the food or water the survival part of the game demands of you.\n\nright now i would not buy this game. with in 30 minutes i was asking for a refund. more time needs to be spent on this game development before i would ever suggest buying it, even at the 8.99 i paid for it. do not waste your money on this. the idea sounds good but they are far from a game that could be enjoyable, even in early release.",
